{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voyagers of Nera is a cooperative survival-crafting game for up to 10 players set in a vast ocean full of ancient ruins and diverse biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nera is a magical ocean world full of beauty, magic, and danger. You are an Echo, descendants of the long-extinct protectors of this world. It falls to you to sail across the seas, defeat the monstrous creatures of the Deep, and awaken the spirits before they fade away forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPMENT ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/676a27b3ad74720000385ba6a6a2b6a2.avif?t=1770874491\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET SAIL ACROSS THE SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo player or a group, sail to distant islands or surf across the waves. Build your own boats from scratch by adding sails, decorations, cannons and magical stations. Dive beneath the surface to find rare resources and hidden treasure, but beware what lurks in the depths\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3827c54523626ae1150cc5a5676ce028.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3827c54523626ae1150cc5a5676ce028.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3827c54523626ae1150cc5a5676ce028.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/f395b24f264764d3ed64b9d6ed182459.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/f395b24f264764d3ed64b9d6ed182459.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE A MAGICAL OCEAN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you to fantastical biomes like an island archipelago formed around a fallen colossus or coral cliffs that tower to the sky. To survive, you\u2019ll have to build mighty seaside bases, craft new weapons, and awaken powerful nature spirits as you battle monstrous creatures both above and below the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/0a3dbc9034762823ccdede6ed4ee2f0d.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/0a3dbc9034762823ccdede6ed4ee2f0d.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/0a3dbc9034762823ccdede6ed4ee2f0d.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/b556460fa8684336c71e6e8b1449afc7.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/b556460fa8684336c71e6e8b1449afc7.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AWAKEN POWERFUL SPIRITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost spirits are scattered throughout the world, hiding from the monsters that prey on them. When you rescue them, they will help you in return by teaching you crafting recipes and new magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome was once the home of a powerful Elder Spirit, but they are now scattered and lost. Find their lost shards and awaken them to inherit their incredible powers and restore the world of Nera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/2239d76d76198ac0f7009b1e98f7e17f.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/2239d76d76198ac0f7009b1e98f7e17f.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/2239d76d76198ac0f7009b1e98f7e17f.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/66f95ad9986ca4cba84c5a35adeeb00e.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/66f95ad9986ca4cba84c5a35adeeb00e.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD THE ULTIMATE ISLAND BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build growing, customizable island villages with an expressive construction system. Each base you build lets you refine resources, cook meals, and craft new gear - it also serves as a sanctuary for the spirits of the world. Build amenities to attract and protect them. In return, they will magically power your settlement, unlocking more powerful crafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/de9ba2fb2d20acfecc8b9c9c3b162fe4.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/de9ba2fb2d20acfecc8b9c9c3b162fe4.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/de9ba2fb2d20acfecc8b9c9c3b162fe4.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/15af35cedc2a09b240c9a15d7d018c10.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/15af35cedc2a09b240c9a15d7d018c10.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOYAGE ALONE OR WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voyagers is a great solo experience and even better with friends! Play with up to 10 people on a server, add new players any time and contribute through different roles. Whether you like to adventure, craft, fight, or build, every choice helps your group progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For multiplayer, you can host a game for others to join, set up your own dedicated server for free, or rent a server from a range of approved partners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/ac387ff3339b9bdf24297208f74ad222.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/ac387ff3339b9bdf24297208f74ad222.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/ac387ff3339b9bdf24297208f74ad222.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3148b67a625c044c2f1456734058ed02.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/3148b67a625c044c2f1456734058ed02.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LAUNCHING INTO EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that all great games need player feedback, and we\u2019ve been playtesting every two weeks since mid 2025. Early Access is our chance to get feedback from a lot more players, which will help us make the game better and better. We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts through our in-game survey, on Steam, and in our Discord. To everyone who\u2019s already played, thank you so much for supporting us and helping us improve the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2686630?t=1770874491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770874491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/90908cb2383da89fe8eafba9f246e14189b6139d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770874491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/90908cb2383da89fe8eafba9f246e14189b6139d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770874491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voyagers of Nera is a cooperative survival-crafting game for up to 10 players set in a vast ocean full of ancient ruins and diverse biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nera is a magical ocean world full of beauty, magic, and danger. You are an Echo, descendants of the long-extinct protectors of this world. It falls to you to sail across the seas, defeat the monstrous creatures of the Deep, and awaken the spirits before they fade away forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPMENT ROADMAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/676a27b3ad74720000385ba6a6a2b6a2.avif?t=1770874491\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SET SAIL ACROSS THE SEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo player or a group, sail to distant islands or surf across the waves. Build your own boats from scratch by adding sails, decorations, cannons and magical stations. Dive beneath the surface to find rare resources and hidden treasure, but beware what lurks in the depths\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3827c54523626ae1150cc5a5676ce028.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3827c54523626ae1150cc5a5676ce028.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/3827c54523626ae1150cc5a5676ce028.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/f395b24f264764d3ed64b9d6ed182459.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/f395b24f264764d3ed64b9d6ed182459.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE A MAGICAL OCEAN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you to fantastical biomes like an island archipelago formed around a fallen colossus or coral cliffs that tower to the sky. To survive, you\u2019ll have to build mighty seaside bases, craft new weapons, and awaken powerful nature spirits as you battle monstrous creatures both above and below the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/0a3dbc9034762823ccdede6ed4ee2f0d.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/0a3dbc9034762823ccdede6ed4ee2f0d.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/0a3dbc9034762823ccdede6ed4ee2f0d.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/b556460fa8684336c71e6e8b1449afc7.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/b556460fa8684336c71e6e8b1449afc7.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AWAKEN POWERFUL SPIRITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost spirits are scattered throughout the world, hiding from the monsters that prey on them. When you rescue them, they will help you in return by teaching you crafting recipes and new magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome was once the home of a powerful Elder Spirit, but they are now scattered and lost. Find their lost shards and awaken them to inherit their incredible powers and restore the world of Nera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/2239d76d76198ac0f7009b1e98f7e17f.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/2239d76d76198ac0f7009b1e98f7e17f.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/2239d76d76198ac0f7009b1e98f7e17f.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/66f95ad9986ca4cba84c5a35adeeb00e.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/66f95ad9986ca4cba84c5a35adeeb00e.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD THE ULTIMATE ISLAND BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build growing, customizable island villages with an expressive construction system. Each base you build lets you refine resources, cook meals, and craft new gear - it also serves as a sanctuary for the spirits of the world. Build amenities to attract and protect them. In return, they will magically power your settlement, unlocking more powerful crafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/de9ba2fb2d20acfecc8b9c9c3b162fe4.poster.avif?t=1770874491\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/de9ba2fb2d20acfecc8b9c9c3b162fe4.webm?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/de9ba2fb2d20acfecc8b9c9c3b162fe4.mp4?t=1770874491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras/15af35cedc2a09b240c9a15d7d018c10.avif?t=1770874491\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686630/extras_big/15af35cedc2a09b240c9a15d7d018c10.avif?t=1770874491 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOYAGE ALONE OR WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voyagers is a great solo experience and even better with friends! Play with up to 10 people on a server, add new players any time and contribute through different roles. Whether you like to adventure, craft, fight, or build, every choice helps your group progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For multiplayer, you can host a game for others to join, set up your own dedicated server for free, or rent a server from a range of approved partners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa